  "title": "Vanilla-Pear Muffins",
  "description": "Vanilla-flavored muffins studded with pears and walnuts are easy to make with this simple recipe that celebrates fall fruit and spices.",
  "authors": [
    "TerryWilson"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:24:08-04:00",
